- op: discuss  # 6be9
  at: '2026-04-16T04:23:53Z'  # 6be9
  by: agent  # 6be9
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 6be9
  clock: 3  # 6be9
  nonce: 6be9  # 6be9
  message: "Fixed in PR #3053 (commit d0382caee). materialize_route_symbols now pre-populates its seen_routes dedupe set with (method, path) pairs from any existing kind='route' symbol in the input, preventing Django's urls.py analyzer route and the view class's concept=route enrichment from producing two symbols for the same route. ANY-method routes (CBV pending WI-lojoh expansion) are intentionally excluded so the materializer can still emit specific-method variants for CBV handler methods. 3 new tests."  # 6be9
